This program makes four files with stats for your Zeus BBS:

Users with most:
...uploads.
...downloads.
...bytes uploaded.
...bytes downloaded.

This is the second release, made in the UK (Version is called 1.0uk).
It's a small bug fix, which UnLoadUser() too.

You can find out what arguments it needs by running it. If you haven't
figured it out yet you need Zeus to use this program. Zeus must also
be running.

